SUMMARY:Two Tales of Terror: J-Horror Unleashed with Best Wishes to All/M
 ina Ni Sachi Are + Gozu | Friday Night Frights
DESCRIPTION:Snacks\, drinks in resealable/enclosed containers (there are 
 no cupholders in the Cinema!)\, and finger foods that do not emit a stron
 g odor or make a mess are allowed for this double feature. Alcohol\, ciga
 rettes\, electronic cigarettes\, and illicit drugs are prohibited at IU C
 inema.        Best Wishes to All/Mina ni sachi are(Yûta Shimotsu\, Japan
 \, 2023): A young woman's visit to her grandparents' home leads to the di
 scovery of what's brought them happiness\, a revelation that will lead he
 r to question her choices\, sanity\, and reality itself. [89 min\; horror
 \; Japanese with English subtitles]        Gozu(Takashi Miike\, Japan\, 2
 003): Acclaimed director Takashi Miike's unhinged Yakuza/horror film cont
 inues to shock and amaze audiences decades after its original release. Mi
 nami is sent to kill his mentor Ozaki (who is in the midst of a nervous b
 reakdown) but soon finds the simple hit quickly morphs into a terrifying 
 and visceral journey into the unexplained and unknown. One of the films i
 n Miike's oeuvre that continues to confound and haunt audiences\, which i
 s saying something! [129 min\; horror\; Japanese with English subtitles]
