SUMMARY:Don't Bother to Knock | Matinee Classics
DESCRIPTION:Hoping to reconcile with his girlfriend Lyn (Anne Bancroft in
  her screen debut)\, pilot Jed Towers (Richard Widmark) arrives at the ho
 tel where she works only to be rebuffed. Meanwhile\, a fragile young woma
 n named Nell Forbes (Marilyn Monroe) is trying to get a fresh start in li
 fe after being in a sanitarium by babysitting for one of the hotel's fami
 lies. Striking up a flirtation with Jed\, Nell slowly becomes more danger
 ous as her grasp on reality begins to loosen\, revealing a haunting\, sur
 prisingly tender portrait of trauma unlike anything else Monroe put on ce
 lluloid. [76 min\; film noir\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Hoping to reconcile with his girlfriend
  Lyn (Anne Bancroft in her screen debut)\, pilot Jed Towers (Richard Widm
 ark) arrives at the hotel where she works only to be rebuffed. Meanwhile\
 , a fragile young woman named Nell Forbes (Marilyn Monroe) is trying to g
 et a fresh start in life after being in a sanitarium by babysitting for o
 ne of the hotel's families. Striking up a flirtation with Jed\, Nell slow
 ly becomes more dangerous as her grasp on reality begins to loosen\, reve
 aling a haunting\, surprisingly tender portrait of trauma unlike anything
  else Monroe put on celluloid. [76 min\; film noir\; English]</p>
