SUMMARY:Decompression Day at IU Cinema
DESCRIPTION:This November 3rd (Election Day—don't forget to vote!)\, IU
  Cinema will open its doors and auditorium from 12-4pm for people to rela
 x\, chill\, work—in general\, just decompress. We'll have low-fi beats 
 on the speakers and an adorable puppy livestream on the screen. Anyone is
  free to come in and can come and go as they please!  A few rules:No food
 —bottled water only\, please!  Headphones/earbuds are required if you a
 re listening to your device.  Be respectful of others and the Cinema and 
 don't leave a mess!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This November 3rd (Election Day—don't
  forget to vote!)\, IU Cinema will open its doors and auditorium from 12-
 4pm for people to relax\, chill\, work—in general\, just decompress. We
 'll have low-fi beats on the speakers and an adorable puppy livestream on
  the screen. Anyone is free to come in and can come and go as they please
 !</p><p>  A few rules:</p><ul><li>No food—bottled water only\, please! 
  </li><li>Headphones/earbuds are required if you are listening to your de
 vice.  </li><li>Be respectful of others and the Cinema and don't leave a 
 mess!  </li></ul>
