SUMMARY:Mad Bills to Pay w/filmmaker | New Americas Cinema
DESCRIPTION:In a tight-knit Dominican American community in The Bronx\, R
 ico (Juan Collado) is hustling his way through the summer\, selling bootl
 eg "nutcracker" cocktails out of a beach cooler and chasing girls without
  a care in the world. But when his teenage girlfriend\, Destiny (Destiny 
 Checo)\, begins crashing at his place with his family\, turning their sma
 ll apartment into a stage for their messy\, complicated young love\, it's
  only a matter of time before they're hit with the sobering reality of gr
 owing up too fast in a city that waits for no one. Writer-director Joel A
 lfonso Vargas turns his hometown into the heartbeat of his debut feature\
 , teaming up with street-cast talent Collado and Checo\, to deliver a raw
  and deeply authentic look at life in The Bronx. [101 min\; comedy\, dram
 a\; English and Spanish with English subtitles]A Q&amp\;A with filmmaker 
 Joel Alfonso Vargas will follow the screening.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  In a tight-knit Dominican American comm
 unity in The Bronx\, Rico (Juan Collado) is hustling his way through the 
 summer\, selling bootleg "nutcracker" cocktails out of a beach cooler and
  chasing girls without a care in the world. But when his teenage girlfrie
 nd\, Destiny (Destiny Checo)\, begins crashing at his place with his fami
 ly\, turning their small apartment into a stage for their messy\, complic
 ated young love\, it's only a matter of time before they're hit with the 
 sobering reality of growing up too fast in a city that waits for no one. 
 Writer-director Joel Alfonso Vargas turns his hometown into the heartbeat
  of his debut feature\, teaming up with street-cast talent Collado and Ch
 eco\, to deliver a raw and deeply authentic look at life in The Bronx. [1
 01 min\; comedy\, drama\; English and Spanish with English subtitles]</p>
 <p><i><strong>A Q&amp\;A with filmmaker Joel Alfonso Vargas will follow t
 he screening.</strong></i></p>
