 in the museum&#8217\;s collections have been affected by conservators\, r
 estorers\, assistants\, and the original artists themselves. Register for
  this free event </strong></i><a class="external" href="https://events.iu
 .edu/bloomington/event/2457787-art-a-movie-at-the-eskenazi-museum-unfinis
 hed-busine"><i><strong>here</strong></i></a><i><strong>.</strong></i></p>
