SUMMARY:In Conversation: Doug Jones + Hellboy II: The Golden Army | Jorge
 nsen Guest Filmmaker Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a conversation with Doug Jones\, one of the most 
 versatile actors working today and the modern successor to classic screen
  icon Lon Chaney. The program will begin with an onstage conversation wit
 h Jones\, followed by a screening of Hellboy II: The Golden Army\, which 
 features an acclaimed performance by Jones as Abe Sapien. After the film\
 , Jones will return to the stage for a post-film chat and take questions 
 from the audience. Note: your tickets to the conversation also includes v
 iewing the film.Hellboy II: The Golden Army\, Guillermo del Toro's follow
 -up to his smash comic book adaptation\, once again finds our (anti) hero
 \, his pyrokinetic girlfriend\, and aquatic empath (Doug Jones) facing th
 eir biggest battle when an underworld prince plans to reclaim Earth for h
 is magical kindred. Only Hellboy and company can stop the dark prince and
  prevent humanity's annihilation. [120 min\; action\, fantasy\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for a conversation with Doug Jo
 nes\, one of the most versatile actors working today and the modern succe
 ssor to classic screen icon Lon Chaney. The program will begin with an on
 stage conversation with Jones\, followed by a screening of <i>Hellboy II:
  The Golden Army</i>\, which features an acclaimed performance by Jones a
 s Abe Sapien. After the film\, Jones will return to the stage for a post-
 film chat and take questions from the audience. <i><strong>Note: your tic
 kets to the conversation also includes viewing the film.</strong></i></p>
 <p><i>Hellboy II: The Golden Army</i>\, Guillermo del Toro's follow-up to
  his smash comic book adaptation\, once again finds our (anti) hero\, his
  pyrokinetic girlfriend\, and aquatic empath (Doug Jones) facing their bi
 ggest battle when an underworld prince plans to reclaim Earth for his mag
 ical kindred. Only Hellboy and company can stop the dark prince and preve
 nt humanity's annihilation. [120 min\; action\, fantasy\; English]</p>
